/gemini-3.5-flash-lite:batch\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"google/gemini-3.5-flash-lite-20260721:batch\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.15e-6\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"1.25e-6\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.015e-6\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Image Input\",\"price\":\"0.15e-6\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Audio\",\"price\":\"0.15e-6\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Audio Cache\",\"price\":\"0.015e-6\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"unit\",\"sku_label\":\"Web Search\",\"price\":\"0.014\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000,\"unitLabel\":\"/1K calls\",\"isServerTool\":true}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.00000015\",\"completion\":\"0.00000125\",\"image\":\"0.00000015\",\"audio\":\"0.00000015\",\"input_audio_cache\":\"0.000000015\",\"web_search\":\"0.014\",\"internal_reasoning\":\"0.00000125\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.000000015\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite-image\",\"permaslug\":\"google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite-image-20260630\",\"name\":\"Google: Nano Banana 2 Lite (Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite Image)\",\"description\":\"Nano Banana 2 Lite (Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite Image) is Google's fastest, most cost-efficient Gemini image model, built for high-velocity developer pipelines and rapid-fire visual exploration. It delivers text-to-image generation in roughly 4 seconds — about 2.7× faster than Gemini 3.1 Flash Image — while keeping the character consistency, precise editing, and real-world knowledge of the Nano Banana family.\\n\\nA single drop-in API handles text-to-image, image editing, and multi-image composition. As a multimodal model it also returns text alongside images. Outputs are generated at 1K resolution across 14 aspect ratios and carry an invisible SynthID watermark so they can be identified as AI-generated.\\n\\nPositioned as the best balance of quality and speed in the Nano Banana 2 line, it lets you generate thousands of images at a fraction of the cost of heavier production models — ideal for prototyping, real-time apps, and visual workflows at scale.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-30T16:33:45.963Z\",\"context_length\":65536,\"output_modalities\":[\"image\",\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite-image\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite-image-20260630\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.00000025\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000015\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Image Output\",\"price\":\"0.00003\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.00000025\",\"completion\":\"0.0000015\",\"image_output\":\"0.00003\",\"web_search\":\"0.014\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"google/gemini-3.1-flash-image\",\"permaslug\":\"google/gemini-3.1-flash-image-20260528\",\"name\":\"Google: Nano Banana 2 (Gemini 3.1 Flash Image)\",\"description\":\"Gemini 3.1 Flash Image, a.k.a. \\\"Nano Banana 2,\\\" is Google’s latest state of the art image generation and editing model, delivering Pro-level visual quality at Flash speed. It combines advanced contextual understanding with fast, cost-efficient inference, making complex image generation and iterative edits significantly more accessible. Aspect ratios can be controlled with the [image_config API Parameter](https://openrouter.ai/docs/features/multimodal/image-generation#image-aspect-ratio-configuration)\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-18T03:41:05.617Z\",\"context_length\":131072,\"output_modalities\":[\"image\",\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"google/gemini-3.1-flash-image\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"google/gemini-3.1-flash-image-20260528\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000005\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.000003\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Image Output\",\"price\":\"0.00006\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"unit\",\"sku_label\":\"Web Search\",\"price\":\"0.014\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000,\"unitLabel\":\"/1K calls\",\"isServerTool\":true}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.0000005\",\"completion\":\"0.000003\",\"image_output\":\"0.00006\",\"web_search\":\"0.014\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"google/gemini-3-pro-image\",\"permaslug\":\"google/gemini-3-pro-image-20260528\",\"name\":\"Google: Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Image)\",\"description\":\"Nano Banana Pro is Google’s most advanced image-generation and editing model, built on Gemini 3 Pro. It extends the original Nano Banana with significantly improved multimodal reasoning, real-world grounding, and high-fidelity visual synthesis. The model generates context-rich graphics, from infographics and diagrams to cinematic composites, and can incorporate real-time information via Search grounding.\\n\\nIt offers industry-leading text rendering in images (including long passages and multilingual layouts), consistent multi-image blending, and accurate identity preservation across up to five subjects. Nano Banana Pro adds fine-grained creative controls such as localized edits, lighting and focus adjustments, camera transformations, and support for 2K/4K outputs and flexible aspect ratios. It is designed for professional-grade design, product visualization, storyboarding, and complex multi-element compositions while remaining efficient for general image creation workflows.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-18T03:40:54.718Z\",\"context_length\":131072,\"output_modalities\":[\"image\",\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"google/gemini-3-pro-image\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"google/gemini-3-pro-image-20260528\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.000002\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.000012\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.0000002\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Write\",\"price\":\"3.75e-7\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Image Input\",\"price\":\"0.000002\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Image Output\",\"price\":\"0.00012\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Audio\",\"price\":\"0.000002\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Audio Cache\",\"price\":\"0.0000002\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"unit\",\"sku_label\":\"Web Search\",\"price\":\"0.014\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000,\"unitLabel\":\"/1K calls\",\"isServerTool\":true}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.000002\",\"completion\":\"0.000012\",\"image\":\"0.000002\",\"image_output\":\"0.00012\",\"audio\":\"0.000002\",\"input_audio_cache\":\"0.0000002\",\"web_search\":\"0.014\",\"internal_reasoning\":\"0.000012\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.0000002\",\"input_cache_write\":\"0.000000375\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"google/gemini-embedding-2\",\"permaslug\":\"google/gemini-embedding-2\",\"name\":\"Google: Gemini Embedding 2\",\"description\":\"Gemini Embedding 2 is Google's first multimodal embedding model. We currently support mapping text and images into a unified vector space for semantic search and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG). It supports input context up to 8,192 tokens and flexible output dimensions from 128 to 3,072 (recommended: 768, 1536, or 3,072). Designed for cross-modal similarity — you can embed a text query and retrieve the most relevant images, or vice versa — making it well-suited for multimodal search, recommendation, and document understanding pipelines.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-20T15:15:35.668Z\",\"context_length\":8192,\"output_modalities\":[\"embeddings\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"google/gemini-embedding-2\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"google/gemini-embedding-2\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Text Input\",\"price\":\"0.0000002\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Image Input\",\"price\":\"0.00000045\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"File Input\",\"price\":\"0.00000045\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Audio Input\",\"price\":\"0.0000065\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Video Input\",\"price\":\"0.000012\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.0000002\",\"completion\":\"0\",\"image\":\"0.00000045\",\"audio\":\"0.0000065\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"google/gemini-embedding-2\",\"permaslug\":\"google/gemini-embedding-2\",\"name\":\"Google: Gemini Embedding 2 (batch)\",\"description\":\"Gemini Embedding 2 is Google's first multimodal embedding model. We currently support mapping text and images into a unified vector space for semantic search and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG). It supports input context up to 8,192 tokens and flexible output dimensions from 128 to 3,072 (recommended: 768, 1536, or 3,072). Designed for cross-modal similarity — you can embed a text query and retrieve the most relevant images, or vice versa — making it well-suited for multimodal search, recommendation, and document understanding pipelines.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-20T15:15:35.668Z\",\"context_length\":8192,\"output_modalities\":[\"embeddings\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"google/gemini-embedding-2:batch\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"google/gemini-embedding-2:batch\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Text Input\",\"price\":\"0.0000001\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Image Input\",\"price\":\"0.000000225\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"File Input\",\"price\":\"0.000000225\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Audio Input\",\"price\":\"0.00000325\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Video Input\",\"price\":\"0.000006\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.0000001\",\"completion\":\"0\",\"image\":\"0.000000225\",\"audio\":\"0.00000325\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"google/gemini-3.5-flash\",\"permaslug\":\"google/gemini-3.5-flash-20260519\",\"name\":\"Google: Gemini 3.5 Flash\",\"description\":\"Gemini 3.5 Flash is Google's high-efficiency multimodal model, bringing near-Pro level coding and reasoning at Flash-tier cost and speed. It is highly optimized for coding proficiency and parallel agentic execution loops, supporting text, image, video, audio, and PDF inputs.\\n\\nDefaults to medium thinking effort for faster and more cost-efficient responses, with full support for thinking levels (minimal, low, medium, high) for fine-grained cost/performance trade-offs.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-05-19T12:30:00.426Z\",\"context_length\":1048576,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"google/gemini-3.5-flash\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"google/gemini-3.5-flash-20260519\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000015\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.000009\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.00000015\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Write\",\"price\":\"8.333333333333334e-8\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Image Input\",\"price\":\"0.0000015\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Audio\",\"price\":\"0.000003\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Audio Cache\",\"price\":\"0.0000003\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"unit\",\"sku_label\":\"Web Search\",\"price\":\"0.014\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000,\"unitLabel\":\"/1K calls\",\"isServerTool\":true}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.0000015\",\"completion\":\"0.000009\",\"image\":\"0.0000015\",\"audio\":\"0.000003\",\"input_audio_cache\":\"0.0000003\",\"web_search\":\"0.014\",\"internal_reasoning\":\"0.000009\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.00000015\",\"input_cache_write\":\"0.00000008333333333333334\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"google/gemini-3.5-flash\",\"permaslug\":\"google/gemini-3.5-flash-20260519\",\"name\":\"Google: Gemini 3.5 Flash (batch)\",\"